@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title PDG construction — PdgBuilder.build(&mut cpg, function)
start
:build intraprocedural CFG
(reachable over ControlFlow edges,
excluding Call edges into callees);<<#D3F9D8>>
:add virtual EXIT node
(sentinel id = u32::MAX,
every real exit connects to it);<<#D3F9D8>>
:reverse the CFG
(edge a -> b becomes b -> a,
rooted at EXIT);<<#D3F9D8>>
:post-dominators via petgraph
dominators::simple_fast on the reversed CFG;<<#E5DBFF>>
:Cytron reverse-dominance-frontier walk
-> ControlDependence edges;<<#E5DBFF>>
:reproject DFG DefUse / ReachingDef
within function -> DataDependence edges;<<#E5DBFF>>
stop
note right
  Idempotent: existing ControlDependence /
  DataDependence edges are snapshotted first,
  so re-running <latex>PdgBuilder.build</latex>
  never duplicates PDG edges.
end note
legend right
  |= colour |= layer |
  |<#D3F9D8>| CFG substrate |
  |<#E5DBFF>| PDG output |
endlegend
@enduml
